### Most frequent confusions (true ? predicted)
- neutral ? sad: 109
- sad ? disgust: 105
- happy ? disgust: 98
- neutral ? disgust: 85
- fear ? sad: 69
- angry ? disgust: 67

`surprise` exists only in RAVDESS, SAVEE and TESS; test recall by corpus: RAVDESS: 0.82 (n=40), SAVEE: 1.00 (n=15), TESS: 0.68 (n=200)

